1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,739
Now the first big idea: how much work does a gas do when it expands?

2
00:00:04,739 --> 00:00:10,598
Take a gas at pressure P in a cylinder, closed by a frictionless piston of area A.

3
00:00:10,598 --> 00:00:16,028
The molecules hammer the piston, and push it with a force F equal to P A.

